{"event_type":"review","id":"f38bfdfce9c80245cede0c8f268654b13f4961e8b70e1af93111cdbdd8dc3101","occurred_at":"2026-11-15T23:41:37Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/37eceecbf634f8601f6fd9a2230dd998f02a20dbd3cac543ccb4f75c1d6686a2","sha256":"37eceecbf634f8601f6fd9a2230dd998f02a20dbd3cac543ccb4f75c1d6686a2"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/0e93bdf21795808f817458c5fd002a0152c954d6407a09ff62299ac55ac1d68f","sha256":"0e93bdf21795808f817458c5fd002a0152c954d6407a09ff62299ac55ac1d68f"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ddf457dc4f5cf76a862021394155cd36a051105454d72944e2ea5d455e068264","sha256":"ddf457dc4f5cf76a862021394155cd36a051105454d72944e2ea5d455e068264"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/6ce4fd126166a17e3b38c392ef34a314e08af79d20ae3cb4d9ae15f77ea76c10","sha256":"6ce4fd126166a17e3b38c392ef34a314e08af79d20ae3cb4d9ae15f77ea76c10"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1ea7c4a66577a42f73a84aaeb0fd2be47018281059247626447190af7e20ba03","sha256":"1ea7c4a66577a42f73a84aaeb0fd2be47018281059247626447190af7e20ba03"}],"attempt_id":"a9da71249c9a3954b3d3bc9fc21738e4973b9aed5b8fab3ec765498bef70f194:0:1","base":"4541019a582091d3dfb052b6bc6b3adf49ef9da2","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"2264e9cdcf8ac58a5037edb0d96f21a118d898c8","body":"**Keep the later of the stored and computed family cooldowns.**\n\nLine 106 writes `next`, the deadline computed from the current failure only (lines 93-98). It replaces any `next_eligible_at` already stored on the family or scope row. A later failure with a shorter `retryAfter` or a lower exponent therefore shortens a deadline that an earlier failure set. For example, a failure with `retryAfter=86400` stores a deadline one day out. A job that was already in flight and fails one second later with `retryAfter=0` computes a two-hour deadline and overwrites it. `eligible()` then treats the family as available after two hours, which drops the one-day floor that the vendor requested.\n\nKeep the later deadline. The stored value is used only when it is later than the computed one.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-    const next = formatted.slice(0, 19) + 'Z';\n+    const computed = formatted.slice(0, 19) + 'Z';\n+    const prior = row.get('next_eligible_at');\n+    const next = typeof prior === 'string' && prior > computed ? prior : computed;\n```\n\n</details>","id":"435aee7c2a247b1b836722971d4196affc9f5cf04ba706abec293505c260a535","intervals":[[106,106]],"path":"src/policy/crq/backfillTerminal.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Keep the later of the stored and computed family cooldowns."}],"head":"9fc68feee831f7928c974d4a86e636b79348ed3a","head_tree":"bda143e5c3801b7c35ed31c000807c5f716cf6f6","input_scope":[{"blob":"96fb848ab93cb8724f4371982293e35317309eb0","intervals":[[1,146]],"path":"src/policy/crq/admissionHistory.ts"},{"blob":"46b338ec6a73074ba1d84c587c1cb047b814e32a","intervals":[[1,172]],"path":"src/policy/crq/authorSnapshot.ts"},{"blob":"4521be2cc8fa57ca0bcfa960c5874b5620e75e33","intervals":[[1,186]],"path":"src/policy/crq/authorWire.ts"},{"blob":"2ee5b7caf418a6f985db97041e1b9f30123872d7","intervals":[[1,209]],"path":"src/policy/crq/backfillCoverage.ts"},{"blob":"2264e9cdcf8ac58a5037edb0d96f21a118d898c8","intervals":[[1,139]],"path":"src/policy/crq/backfillTerminal.ts"},{"blob":"1a6e70553b6960375480e4b14630721c343a6764","intervals":[[1,190]],"path":"src/policy/crq/pythonReviewRegex.ts"},{"blob":"bfcec238abfb1790efa10ca64507de3bb9605358","intervals":[[1,199]],"path":"src/policy/crq/reconcileReport.ts"},{"blob":"b6bd57cf2e67418bb0c31a124150b53d379e95f6","intervals":[[1,190]],"path":"src/policy/crq/reviewNotify.ts"}],"job_id":